
---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="Organic Intelligence for Traders"
      description="One-to-one Organic Intelligence coaching for traders. Develop the capacity to meet uncertainty, stress and the demands of trading."
    />

<a
  href="/course"
  style="display:inline-block; margin-top:24px; padding:14px 20px; background:#252520; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-size:14px;"
>
  Explore the free trading course →
</a>

  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/">OI<span>.</span></a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
        <a href="#coaching">Coaching</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Get in touch ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          ORGANIC INTELLIGENCE · TRADING
        </div>

        <h1>Trading puts your nervous system under pressure<span>.</span></h1>

        <p class="intro">
          Develop the capacity to meet it.
        </p>

        <p class="sub">
          One-to-one Organic Intelligence coaching for traders navigating
          uncertainty, stress and the demands of high-performance decision-making.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="#coaching">
          Explore coaching <span>↗</span>
        </a>

        <div class="hero-note">
          <span>01 /</span> PERFORMANCE IS MORE THAN STRATEGY
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section problem" id="approach">
        <p class="label">THE CHALLENGE</p>
        <h2>You can know exactly what to do — and still struggle to do it.</h2>
        <div class="body-copy">
          <p>
            Trading asks a lot of you. Uncertainty, rapid decisions, volatility,
            wins, losses and the constant temptation to act can create a level
            of demand that is difficult to navigate.
          </p>
          <p>
            More discipline, better rules and another strategy may not address
            the whole problem. How you respond to pressure matters, too.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section approach">
        <p class="label">A DIFFERENT APPROACH</p>
        <h2>Build capacity, not just control.</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <article>
            <span class="number">01</span>
            <h3>Understand your responses</h3>
            <p>
              Explore how pressure, uncertainty and activation shape your
              experience — without turning every reaction into a problem to fix.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="number">02</span>
            <h3>Develop greater capacity</h3>
            <p>
              Build your ability to meet challenging experiences without
              relying exclusively on suppression, avoidance or willpower.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="number">03</span>
            <h3>Make room for more choice</h3>
            <p>
              Develop a more flexible relationship with pressure, so that
              difficult internal experiences don't have to dictate your next move.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section coaching" id="coaching">
        <p class="label">ONE-TO-ONE COACHING</p>
        <h2>Work with the person behind the trader.</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          Organic Intelligence is a nervous-system-informed approach that
          emphasises orientation, connection and the development of capacity.
          Rather than trying to force yourself into the right state, we work
          with your experience as it unfolds.
        </p>
        <p class="body-copy">
          Sessions are tailored to you and the demands you're navigating.
          The focus is on your relationship with pressure, not on providing
          trading signals, strategies or financial advice.
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="#contact">Discuss working together ↗</a>
      </section>

      <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <p class="label">START A CONVERSATION</p>
        <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>
        <p>
          Get in touch to talk about what you're experiencing and whether
          one-to-one coaching could be a fit.
        </p>
        <a
          class="button button-light"
          href="https://x.com/youngtilopa"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          Reach out on X ↗
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a class="brand" href="/">OI<span>.</span></a>
      <p>Organic Intelligence for Traders</p>
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()}</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f6f2;
    color: #20221f;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; }
  :global(a:hover) { color: #727766; }
  .nav {
    height: 82px;
    max-width: 1160px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e3dc;
  }
  .brand {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }
  .brand span, .hero h1 span { color: #8a9277; }
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; }
  nav a { text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; }
  .nav-cta { border-bottom: 1px solid #20221f; padding-bottom: 4px; }
  .hero {
    max-width: 1160px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 120px 32px 54px;
    min-height: 610px;
  }
  .eyebrow, .label, .hero-note {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.7px;
  }
  .eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: #899378;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 850px;
    font-size: clamp(46px, 7.3vw, 88px);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 34px 0 22px;
  }
  .intro { font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .sub { max-width: 530px; color: #686a62; font-size: 16px; }
  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 26px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding: 14px 19px;
    background: #292c26;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .button:hover { background: #555b4c; color: white; }
  .hero-note {
    border-top: 1px solid #deddd5;
    margin-top: 92px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    color: #77786f;
  }
  .hero-note span { color: #272922; margin-right: 12px; }
  .section {
    padding: 100px max(32px, calc((100% - 1096px) / 2));
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e3dc;
  }
  .label { color: #797d6d; margin: 0 0 26px; }
  .section h2, .contact h2 {
    max-width: 750px;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 54px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }
  .body-copy { max-width: 650px; color: #65675f; }
  .body-copy p { margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 35px;
    margin-top: 55px;
  }
  .cards article {
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid #c9c9be;
  }
  .number { font-size: 11px; color: #878b78; }
  .cards h3 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 500; margin: 28px 0 12px; }
  .cards p { font-size: 14px; color: #686a62; }
  .coaching { background: #eeede6; }
  .contact {
    padding: 100px 32px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #292c26;
    color: #f7f6f2;
  }
  .contact .label { color: #b8bda9; }
  .contact h2 { margin: 0 auto 20px; }
  .contact > p:not(.label) {
    max-width: 490px; margin: 0 auto; color: #d0d0c7;
  }
  .button-light { background: #f7f6f2; color: #292c26; }
  .button-light:hover { background: #dcded3; color: #292c26; }
  footer {
    min-height: 110px;
    max-width: 1160px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 25px 32px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    color: #77786f;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  footer p { margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .nav { height: 70px; padding: 0 20px; }
    nav { gap: 15px; }
    nav a { font-size: 12px; }
    .hero { padding: 90px 22px 35px; min-height: auto; }
    .hero h1 { letter-spacing: -2.5px; }
    .hero-note { margin-top: 65px; }
    .section { padding: 72px 22px; }
    .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 25px; }
    .contact { padding: 75px 22px; }
    footer { padding: 24px 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }
</style>
